      "cooked": "<p>Here’s the obligatory thread in which to discuss the attempts (and hopefully successes, eventually) at unlocking the latest variant.</p>\n<p>This week: X-TREME Prime Wardens Argent Adept!</p>\n<p>My attempt (which did not succeed) went as follows, and was inspired by the details put forth by the team’s bio, as found during the ARG.</p>\n<p>First, I lost against Progeny, with the normal Prime Wardens team (vanilla characters, no variants.) and then, just to be safe, I did the same with the Prime Wardens variants.</p>\n<p>Then, I had the team beat up some Villains (Biomancer, Greazer, Miss Information, Operative, and Bugbear; the ones that has their nemeses in them. Biomancer was chosen because he was explicitly mentioned in their bio).</p>\n<p>Then they defeated Progeny, again in their Prime Wardens variants, in Atlantis.</p>",
